\ Regression: a frame emitted inside a compound-spliced region bakes the
\ callee's source file. The literal 5 is the typed operand the splicer
\ requires, so `combine`'s body splices into the entry body, and the opaque
\ string operand sends the spliced `+` to the mixed-operand trap at runtime.
\ The error's innermost frame must name the support module's file and line,
\ not this file.

use "./support/splice_mixed_add.1z" ;

"str" 5 combine drop
